    {
      "block_id": "2605.23244_p4_b13",
      "text": "The DPO objective in (5) is a large-scale non-convex opti-\nmization, which is challenging to solve. We first reformu-\nlate this learning problem using cvxNN, in order to admit\nmore elegant optimization techniques. We adopt a modified\nBradley-Terry model with an offset parameter \u03b3 > 0.\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.13,
        206.0,
        291.1,
        263.85
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
