    {
      "block_id": "2605.23244_p4_b17",
      "text": "Instead of taking \u03c0 in (7) to be a traditional neural network\n(NN) model, we replace it with a cvxNN. Specifically, we\ntake a pre-trained model f\u03b8pre(x) and stack a two-layer con-\nvex neural network gcvx\n",
