      "text": "Notably, (8) is reference-free in comparison to (5) yet does\nnot incur additional scaling hyperparameters for stability.\nThis is supported in recent work (Hong et al., 2024; Meng\net al., 2024; Gupta et al., 2024), where we find the reference\nmodel unnecessary.\n",
