      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Medi",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 20,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.23244_p4_b62",
      "text": "We formally present the pseudocode for COALA in Algo-\nrithm 1. Stage one of COALA first trains a cvxNN on top of\na standard pre-trained model. In stage two, the final policy\nmodel is obtained by solving a convex logistic regression\nproblem in a fine-tuning step.\n",
      "bbox": [
        306.97,
        437.94,
        543.09,
        495.8
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        1227,
        1751,
        2172,
